{# Transactional email for the 48h set-password / reset link (build-notes §2b).
   Not one of the three notices previewed on the Email notices screen — that
   screen is scoped to exactly the three the client asked for — but required
   for account creation and password reset to actually work. is_reset picks
   the copy for an admin-issued reset vs. a brand-new account. #}
{% extends "mail/_layout.html.twig" %}
{% import "mail/_macros.html.twig" as m %}
{% block subject %}{{ is_reset|default(false) ? 'Reset' : 'Set' }} your password — Expenditure &amp; Encumbrance Requests{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}Your link expires in 48 hours and can only be used once.{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
{{ m.heading(is_reset|default(false) ? 'Reset your password' : 'Set your password') }}
{{ m.p('Hi ' ~ (name|e) ~ ',') }}
{% if is_reset|default(false) %}
{{ m.p('Admin / Tech has reset your sign-in for Southeastern&rsquo;s Expenditure &amp; Encumbrance Request System. Use the button below to choose a new password. Approvers will also be asked to set a new sign-off PIN.') }}
{% else %}
{{ m.p('An account has been created for you on Southeastern&rsquo;s Expenditure &amp; Encumbrance Request System. Use the button below to choose your password.') }}
{% endif %}
{{ m.details({'Link expires': 'in 48 hours', 'Use': 'once only'}) }}
{{ m.button(cta_url, is_reset|default(false) ? 'Reset your password' : 'Set your password') }}
{{ m.link_fallback(cta_url) }}
{{ m.p('<span style="font-size:12px;color:#5F5F5F;">The system is only reachable from the Southeastern office network. If you didn&rsquo;t expect this email, let Admin / Tech know.</span>') }}
{% endblock %}
{% block plain %}{% autoescape false %}Hi {{ name }},

{% if is_reset|default(false) %}Admin / Tech has reset your sign-in for Southeastern's Expenditure & Encumbrance Request System. Use the link below to choose a new password. Approvers will also be asked to set a new sign-off PIN.{% else %}An account has been created for you on Southeastern's Expenditure & Encumbrance Request System. Use the link below to choose your password.{% endif %}

The link expires in 48 hours and can only be used once:
{{ cta_url }}

The system is only reachable from the Southeastern office network. If you didn't expect this email, let Admin / Tech know.{% endautoescape %}{% endblock %}
